            {
              "id": "1761715634929_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the following Change Task data Context about a change order tasks, summarize the key details relevant for a product manager. Ensure the summary uses language and context appropriate for a product manager and prioritizes information useful for decision-making.\n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nChange Task data Context:\n{{$context.$nodes.GETCHANGETASKS.$output}}\n\nFor each Task generate a actionable insight ora.invoke(COTASKDETAILSACTION,`CR-Task-<TaskId>`). ActionText must be \"View Details\".\n\nDISAPLAY\n** Display a title \"Pending Tasks\"."
            }
